# Image Directory

Add your wildlife photography images to this directory.

## Required Images

### Home Page
- hero.jpg - Full-screen hero image (2560x1440 recommended)
- featured-1.jpg through featured-6.jpg - Featured work grid
- story-hero.jpg - Featured story hero image
- story-support-1.jpg, story-support-2.jpg - Story supporting images
- closing-cta.jpg - Final CTA background
- species-birds.jpg, species-mammals.jpg, species-macro.jpg, species-landscapes.jpg, species-moments.jpg

### Wildlife Portfolio
- portfolio-1.jpg through portfolio-60.jpg - Gallery images

### Stories
- story-vedanthangal.jpg
- story-pulicat.jpg
- story-bandipur.jpg
- story-mudumalai.jpg
- story-nilgiris.jpg

### Species
- species-painted-stork-1.jpg, species-painted-stork-2.jpg
- species-elephant-1.jpg, species-elephant-2.jpg
- species-kingfisher-1.jpg, species-kingfisher-2.jpg

### About
- about-portrait.jpg - Photographer portrait

### Contact
- contact-bg.jpg - Background image

## Image Guidelines

- Minimum width: 1920px
- Format: JPG or PNG
- Compress for web (80-90% quality)
- Use consistent editing
- Maintain proper subject positioning
